{'symbol': 'INTC', 'date': '2019-10-14 22:30:00', 'title': 'INTEL CORPORATION (NASDAQGS:INTC) ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE SMART\xa0EDGE\xa0BUSINESS FROM SMART EDGE BUSINESS OF SMART-EDGE.COM, INC. FOR $27 MILLION.', 'text': "INTEL CORPORATION (NASDAQGS:INTC) ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE SMART\xa0EDGE\xa0BUSINESS FROM SMART-EDGE.COM, INC. FOR $27 MILLION ON OCTOBER 14, 2019. INTEL WILL ACQUIRE ALL OF THE ASSETS IN CASH AND WILL ASSUME CERTAIN SPECIFIED LIABILITIES. A PORTION OF THE PURCHASE PRICE WILL BE HELD BACK BY INTEL AT THE CLOSING AS PARTIAL SECURITY FOR THE INDEMNIFICATION OBLIGATIONS OF SMART-EDGE.COM. IN A RELATED TRANSACTION PIVOT\xa0AND\xa0INTEL\xa0HAVE\xa0ENTERED\xa0INTO\xa0A\xa0THREE-YEAR\xa0PREFERRED CHANNEL\xa0PARTNER\xa0AGREEMENT\xa0WHICH\xa0DESIGNATES\xa0PIVOT\xa0AS\xa0A\xa0NON-EXCLUSIVE\xa0PREFERRED\xa0SYSTEM\xa0INTEGRATOR\xa0AND\xa0CHANNEL\xa0PARTNER\xa0FOR\xa0SMART\xa0EDGE\xa0BASED\xa0SOLUTIONS. THE AGREEMENT MAY BE TERMINATED ANY TIME PRIOR TO CLOSING BY MUTUAL WRITTEN CONSENT OF INTEL AND SMART-EDGE.COM. ALL SMART\xa0EDGE\xa0EMPLOYEES,\xa0INCLUDING\xa0SMART\xa0EDGE'S\xa0CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER,\xa0BOB\xa0PIKE,\xa0WILL\xa0JOIN\xa0INTEL’S\xa0NETWORK\xa0AND\xa0CUSTOM\xa0LOGIC\xa0GROUP\xa0(NCLG)\xa0ONCE\xa0THE\xa0TRANSACTION\xa0IS COMPLETE. THE TRANSACTION\xa0IS\xa0SUBJECT\xa0TO\xa0CUSTOMARY\xa0CLOSING\xa0CONDITIONS, APPROVALS AND CLEARANCES OF GOVERNMENTAL ENTITIES, THIRD PARTY APPROVAL AND EMPLOYMENT AGREEMENTS. THE TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE DURING THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2019.\n"}